Package: deepcoolgo
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Live CPU telemetry on DeepCool LCD coolers
 DeepCoolGo reads CPU load, temperature, clock speed and power draw from the
 Linux kernel and renders a 320x240 frame to the LCD on a DeepCool cooler
 over USB. Every visual is produced by a theme - a Go plugin (.so) - so the
 display can be restyled without touching the daemon.
